---
// src/pages/en/trust.astro
// Trust & Compliance Pack: 60-Second Verification for IT Directors, DPOs & School Districts
import Header from "../../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../../components/Footer.astro";
import "../../styles/global.css";
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" class="scroll-smooth">
<head>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <link rel="alternate icon" type="image/png" href="/favicon.png" />
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Trust & Compliance Pack (DPA, FERPA, SDPC, GDPR, EU AI Act) | ColabEdu.net</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Sign-ready institutional compliance pack: GDPR Art. 28 DPA, US FERPA/COPPA/SDPC Addendum, EU AI Act Transparency Sheet, and Chrome MV3 Security Architecture.">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style is:global>
        :root {
            --font-sans: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
            --font-mono: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
        }
        body {
            font-family: var(--font-sans);
            background-color: #FAF9F6;
            color: #0F172A;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
        }
        .precision-card {
            background-color: #FFFFFF;
            border: 1px solid #E2E8F0;
            border-radius: 1.25rem;
            box-shadow: 0 1px 3px 0 rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.03);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <Header lang="en" currentPath="/en/trust" />

    <main class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16 space-y-12">
        <section class="text-center space-y-4">
            <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-teal-50 border border-teal-200 text-teal-800 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">
                60-Second Institutional Verification
            </span>
            <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-900">
                Trust &amp; Compliance Pack
            </h1>
            <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
                Sign-ready legal agreements and technical security architecture for IT Directors, Data Protection Officers (DPOs), and School Districts.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
            <div class="precision-card p-6 space-y-3">
                <h2 class="text-lg font-extrabold text-slate-900">1. Zero External Retention Architecture</h2>
                <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
                    The Chrome Extension (Manifest V3) parses rubrics and submissions ephemerally inside the educator's authenticated browser tab. Student PII is never sold, shared with ad networks, or stored on intermediary servers.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="precision-card p-6 space-y-3">
                <h2 class="text-lg font-extrabold text-slate-900">2. EU AI Act &amp; Zero Model Training</h2>
                <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
                    Mandatory Human-in-the-Loop oversight: grades and rubric selections require explicit teacher approval. Student voice recordings, handwriting, and essays are never used to train foundation AI models.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="precision-card p-6 space-y-3">
                <h2 class="text-lg font-extrabold text-slate-900">3. Chrome MV3 Least-Privilege</h2>
                <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
                    No <code>&lt;all_urls&gt;</code> and zero remote code execution (<code>eval</code> forbidden). Production builds restrict <code>host_permissions</code> to official LMS domains and request self-hosted <code>.edu</code>/<code>.org</code> origins only on demand via <code>optional_host_permissions</code>.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="precision-card p-6 space-y-3">
                <h2 class="text-lg font-extrabold text-slate-900">4. Regional Data Sovereignty (US / EU)</h2>
                <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
                    Strict multi-tenant isolation with regional data residency in the United States (FERPA / COPPA / SOPPA / SDPC) or the European Union (GDPR / LOPDGDD).
                </p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="precision-card p-8 space-y-6">
            <div>
                <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-slate-900">Downloadable Sign-Ready Documents (PDF)</h2>
                <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mt-1">
                    Ready for district procurement, Google Workspace / MDM allowlist reviews, and DPO compliance records.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
                <a href="/legal/ColabEdu-US-SDPC-FERPA-Exhibit.pdf" download class="flex items-center justify-between p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 hover:border-teal-500 hover:bg-teal-50/40 transition">
                    <div>
                        <div class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm">US Student Data Privacy Addendum (FERPA / SDPC)</div>
                        <div class="text-xs text-slate-500">COPPA &amp; SOPPA aligned · Signature block included</div>
                    </div>
                    <span class="text-teal-700 font-bold text-xs px-2.5 py-1 bg-teal-100 rounded-lg">PDF</span>
                </a>
                <a href="/legal/ColabEdu-DPA-GDPR-EN.pdf" download class="flex items-center justify-between p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 hover:border-teal-500 hover:bg-teal-50/40 transition">
                    <div>
                        <div class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm">Standard GDPR Art. 28 DPA</div>
                        <div class="text-xs text-slate-500">English · Signature block included</div>
                    </div>
                    <span class="text-teal-700 font-bold text-xs px-2.5 py-1 bg-teal-100 rounded-lg">PDF</span>
                </a>
                <a href="/legal/ColabEdu-EU-AI-Act-Transparency-Sheet.pdf" download class="flex items-center justify-between p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 hover:border-teal-500 hover:bg-teal-50/40 transition">
                    <div>
                        <div class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm">EU AI Act Transparency &amp; Oversight Sheet</div>
                        <div class="text-xs text-slate-500">Regulation (EU) 2024/1689 · OPS Grounding</div>
                    </div>
                    <span class="text-teal-700 font-bold text-xs px-2.5 py-1 bg-teal-100 rounded-lg">PDF</span>
                </a>
                <a href="/legal/ColabEdu-Extension-Security-OnePager.pdf" download class="flex items-center justify-between p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 hover:border-teal-500 hover:bg-teal-50/40 transition">
                    <div>
                        <div class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm">Chrome Extension MV3 Security One-Pager</div>
                        <div class="text-xs text-slate-500">IT / MDM &amp; Google Workspace Allowlist Guide</div>
                    </div>
                    <span class="text-teal-700 font-bold text-xs px-2.5 py-1 bg-teal-100 rounded-lg">PDF</span>
                </a>
            </div>

            <div class="pt-4 border-t border-slate-200 flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-4">
                <div class="text-sm text-slate-600">
                    Need a countersigned district DPA or MDM allowlist verification?
                </div>
                <div class="flex gap-3">
                    <a href="/en/data-sovereignty-privacy" class="px-4 py-2 rounded-lg border border-slate-300 text-slate-700 font-semibold text-sm hover:bg-slate-50 transition">
                        Full Privacy Doctrine
                    </a>
                    <a href="mailto:privacy@colabedu.org?subject=ColabEdu%20DPA%20and%20Allowlist%20Request" class="px-4 py-2 rounded-lg bg-slate-900 text-white font-semibold text-sm hover:bg-slate-800 transition">
                        Contact DPO
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>

    <Footer lang="en" />
</body>
</html>
